    ],
    "page": "table 2-1 (address and reset pins must be biased); 1.6 serial interface"
  },
  "notes": [
    "I2C address 0100 A2 A1 A0: 0x20-0x27.",
    "GPA7 and GPB7 are outputs only on this part (current datasheet): put inputs on the other 14 pins.",
    "INTA/INTB can be mirrored into one interrupt (IOCON.MIRROR) and set open drain (IOCON.ODR) to share a line with a pull-up."
